From 0b36c6ea2aac3fd22e76cfc00066fe99bbaa399a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:14:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] /requests/mine: expires_at for a request still waiting
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The frontend's 15:05Z: the design's „expires after 14 days" line was
left out because no route gave the number. Each waiting request now
carries expires_at, computed from the expiry sweep's own rule (14 days
from the last answer, else from the request; EXPIRES_AFTER_DAYS, not a
new number); null once answered.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
